{'symbol': 'INFO', 'date': '2021-08-04 10:47:00', 'title': 'AUTOMOTIVEMASTERMIND FORMS RELATIONSHIP WITH FORDDIRECT TO ENHANCE MASTERMIND FOR FORD AND LINCOLN DEALERS', 'text': 'NEW YORK, AUG. 4, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0AUTOMOTIVEMASTERMIND ®, PART OF IHS MARKIT\xa0(NYSE: INFO) AND A PROVIDER OF PREDICTIVE ANALYTICS AND MARKETING AUTOMATION SOLUTIONS FOR DEALERSHIPS, HAS FORMED A PARTNERSHIP WITH FORDDIRECT. AS A RESULT OF THE RELATIONSHIP, NEW INTEGRATIONS WILL BE OFFERED TO BOTH CURRENT AND FUTURE FORD AND LINCOLN DEALERSHIPS IN THE UNITED STATES THAT USE MASTERMIND – THE AUTOMATED SALES AND MARKETING PLATFORM THAT EMPOWERS DEALERS TO CLOSE MORE DEALS BY PREDICTING FUTURE BUYERS AND CONSISTENTLY MARKETING TO THEM.'}